        a               sh:NodeShape ;
        rdfs:label      "ActivityProfile" ;
        sh:description  "The name \"ActivityProfile\"  has been chosen because lis:Activity corresponds to BFO's 'process'." , "An 'activity profile' is a part of an 'activity', a \"selective abstraction\" (using a term from the BFO reference guide) made according to a quality of interest to the process. Typically, we will select a physical quantity such as pressure or temperature, and refer to the \"pressure profile\" of the activity. By means of the relation 'profile quantity datum', the activity profile can be related to a set of 'quantity datum' individuals, to which aggregation can be applied, giving a basis for classification." ;
